# Canonical identity for this project.
#
# Git records whatever name was configured at commit time, so history accumulates variants:
# "Tom Grech" from the early commits here, and the GitHub account identity on anything committed
# through github.com rather than from a local clone. This file maps every variant onto one name
# WITHOUT rewriting history — no changed commit hashes, no force push, nothing to break on a
# second machine.
#
# Applies to git log, shortlog and blame. It does NOT change what github.com displays.

Thomas Grech <tomgrech@hotmail.com>
